{"3127100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My CV", "steam_appid": 3127100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My CV </strong>is a first-person interactive experience set in a quiet modern home deep in the woods. Inside the house, the walls tell a story — framed projects, sketches, and handwritten notes replace traditional menus and resumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the space at your own pace. Walk through rooms filled with paintings that represent real projects, and discover pinboards covered with notes that explain how each piece was made, what problems it solved, and the tools behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no objectives to chase and no paths to follow.<br>This is a space for reflection, curiosity, and craft.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My CV </strong>is a first-person interactive experience set in a quiet modern home deep in the woods. Inside the house, the walls tell a story — framed projects, sketches, and handwritten notes replace traditional menus and resumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the space at your own pace. Walk through rooms filled with paintings that represent real projects, and discover pinboards covered with notes that explain how each piece was made, what problems it solved, and the tools behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no objectives to chase and no paths to follow.<br>This is a space for reflection, curiosity, and craft.</p>", "short_description": "A short first-person exploration experience where you walk through a modern house in the woods and interact with paintings and notes that present real software, game, and hardware projects.", "supported_languages": "English, Slovenian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127100/a64dcb48838da1e282f4201ee38014b0a562aa9d/header.jpg?t=1777833780", "capsule_image": "https://shared.aka